// CHECK: box_errors.pia:51:12: proved: the index is within bounds [smt]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:50:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:41:3: proved: the index is within bounds [smt]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:40:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:56:22: proved: the index is within bounds [smt]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:55:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:15:21: proved: '-' does not overflow usize [smt]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:17:22: proved: '+' does not overflow usize [smt]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:18:31: proved: '+' does not overflow usize [smt]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:18:9: proved: the slice is within bounds [smt]
