// CHECK: box_errors.pia:38:1: not proved generically: 'get' is proved at each instance, since it takes a value of box<t> [generic]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:43:1: not proved generically: 'set' is proved at each instance, since it returns a value of box<t> [generic]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:48:1: not proved generically: 'release' is proved at each instance, since it returns a value of box<t> [generic]
// CHECK: box_errors.pia:53:1: not proved generically: 'fill' is proved at each instance, since it returns a value of box<t> [generic]
// CHECK: 22 proved, 2 failed, 0 skipped
*)
